WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A picture has an edge.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Memory may redraw it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Sometimes wider.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Sometimes narrower.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An experiment is not product proof.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free exercise. Inspect the source.
